  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bosnia and Herzegovina Water and Sanitation Sector Modernization Project Single Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to support Bosnia and Herzegovina to: (i) strengthen the institutional capacity at the Republika Srpska (RS), Federation of Bosnia and Herzegovina (FBiH), and local levels for improved water supply and sanitation (WSS) service delivery, (ii) improve access to safely managed WSS services, and (iii) improve efficiency of WSS service providers in participating local governments.</narrative>
  </description>
